00:42:58,840 --> 00:43:04,840
First is, are you going to reveal a massive red flag that makes you completely wrong for the job?

1030
00:43:04,840 --> 00:43:10,280
Right. And second, and this is a really critical professional articulation test,

1031
00:43:10,280 --> 00:43:14,200
How well can you professionally express yourself and show self-awareness?

1032
00:43:14,200 --> 00:43:19,000
Because if you stumble or you sound fake or you use some tired cliche...

1033
00:43:19,000 --> 00:43:20,680
It just signals you're not prepared.

1034
00:43:20,680 --> 00:43:21,080
Yeah.

1035
00:43:21,080 --> 00:43:23,080
That you don't have that professional maturity.

1036
00:43:23,080 --> 00:43:27,960
It shows you haven't learned the secret language of these high-stakes interviews.

1037
00:43:27,960 --> 00:43:30,760
So the articulation itself is the signal of confidence.

1038
00:43:30,760 --> 00:43:32,760
It is. The articulation is the signal.

1039
00:43:32,760 --> 00:43:36,440
So, okay, how do you pass this test? It has to come down to structure.

