00:43:44,960 --> 00:43:46,200
This is the framework.

1045
00:43:46,200 --> 00:43:48,360
10% of your answer, just 10%,

1046
00:43:48,360 --> 00:43:51,480
is for naming a specific, tangible weakness.

1047
00:43:51,480 --> 00:43:53,720
Brief, clear, to the point.

1048
00:43:53,720 --> 00:43:54,880
And the other 90%.

1049
00:43:54,880 --> 00:43:56,120
That's where the power is.

1050
00:43:56,120 --> 00:43:58,520
The remaining 90% is all about

1051
00:43:58,520 --> 00:44:00,240
discussing your self-awareness.

1052
00:44:00,240 --> 00:44:02,800
Yeah. And detailing the active, ongoing steps

1053
00:44:02,800 --> 00:44:04,400
you are taking to get better.

1054
00:44:04,400 --> 00:44:07,480
The employer is looking for a self-correcting organism,

1055
00:44:07,480 --> 00:44:08,900
not a perfect one.

1056
00:44:08,900 --> 00:44:10,200
That's a great way to put it.

1057
00:44:10,200 --> 00:44:13,040
They want to see your growth mindset in action.

1058
00:44:13,040 --> 00:44:16,200
But first, let's talk about what to avoid,

