00:44:20,040 --> 00:44:22,600
You absolutely have to avoid the disguised compliments.

1062
00:44:22,600 --> 00:44:24,480
I'm a perfectionist.

1063
00:44:24,480 --> 00:44:27,880
Yes, which really means I will hold up the workflow

1064
00:44:27,880 --> 00:44:29,160
because I'm inefficient.

1065
00:44:29,160 --> 00:44:30,440
Or I work too hard.

1066
00:44:30,440 --> 00:44:34,000
Which means I have no boundaries and I'm gonna burn out.

1067
00:44:34,000 --> 00:44:35,760
And definitely, I'm too honest.

1068
00:44:35,760 --> 00:44:37,680
Which just translates to, I have no tact

1069
00:44:37,680 --> 00:44:40,040
and I'm probably difficult to work with.

1070
00:44:40,040 --> 00:44:42,440
All of them just signal you're not being sincere.

1071
00:44:42,440 --> 00:44:44,640
So this brings up a key point.

