00:44:54,040 --> 00:44:55,280
That's a great question.

1077
00:44:55,280 --> 00:44:57,400
Authenticity is all about the detail.

1078
00:44:57,400 --> 00:44:58,840
If you name a hard skill,

1079
00:44:58,840 --> 00:45:01,800
like you're not great with a specific piece of software,

1080
00:45:01,800 --> 00:45:04,800
You can easily detail the 90% part.

1081
